{#
settings/_inbox_tabs.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Every inbox tab on one list, in the order the inbox draws them: the built-in
ones with a switch, the reader's own with rename and delete, and all of them
but Primary in an order the reader drags into place.

ONE LIST, NOT TWO. The strip is one row of tabs whichever kind each one is, so
arranging it is one list too — a reader's "Shipping" belongs between Updates
and Promotions if that is where they look for it.

PRIMARY IS NOT IN THE SORTABLE LIST. It is always first and cannot be switched
off: it is the tab the inbox opens on and where a switched-off tab's mail goes.
A row that looked like the others but refused to move would be a puzzle; a row
above the list that says why it stays is not.

A switch posts on change, like every other switch on these pages, and
re-sorts the mailbox (InboxCategoryController::switch). The order is written as
one JSON list after every move (settings--tab-order). Rename, delete and add
are plain posts that come back to this page.

What fills a tab of the reader's own is a filter's "File in category" action,
so the card says so and links there: a tab with nothing filing into it stays
out of the strip, and a card that did not explain that would look broken the
first time somebody made one.

Accepts:
  tabs         InboxTab[]          every tab, switched off or not, in order
  switchedOff  MessageCategory[]   the built-ins switched off
#}
{% set segText = 'flex h-full items-center justify-center px-2.5 py-1 text-center text-[11px] leading-tight text-ink-muted
                  peer-checked:bg-accent peer-checked:text-accent-ink
                  peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-inset peer-focus-visible:ring-accent
                  transition-colors cursor-pointer' %}
{% set moveButton = 'w-5 h-4 flex items-center justify-center rounded text-ink-faint hover:text-ink hover:bg-hover transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-30 disabled:cursor-not-allowed' %}

<div class="px-4 py-3">
    <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint">
        {{ 'settings.categories.hint'|trans }}
        <a href="{{ path('app_settings_index', { section: 'filters' }) }}" class="text-accent hover:underline">{{ 'settings.categories.filters_link'|trans }}</a>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-3 rounded-pane border border-line">
        {% set primary = tabs|first %}
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-line" data-tab-fixed="{{ primary.value }}">
            <span class="w-5 shrink-0 flex justify-center text-ink-faint" aria-hidden="true">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-thumbtack text-[10px]"></i>
            </span>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">{{ ('tabs.' ~ primary.value)|trans }}</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint">{{ 'settings.categories.primary_fixed'|trans }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="divide-y divide-line"
            data-controller="settings--tab-order"
            data-settings--tab-order-url-value="{{ path('app_settings_categories_order') }}"
            data-settings--tab-order-csrf-value="{{ csrf_token('settings-categories') }}"
            data-settings--tab-order-target="list">
            {% for tab in tabs|slice(1) %}
                {% set label = tab.builtIn ? ('tabs.' ~ tab.value)|trans : tab.name %}
                {% set isOff = tab.builtIn and tab.builtIn in switchedOff %}
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2.5" data-tab-key="{{ tab.value }}">
                    {# Buttons as well as a handle, as on the account list: a drag
                       is unreachable from a keyboard and fiddly on a phone. #}
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-center shrink-0">
                        <button type="button" data-action="settings--tab-order#move" data-direction="up"
                                class="{{ moveButton }}" {{ loop.first ? 'disabled' : '' }}
                                aria-label="{{ 'settings.categories.move_up'|trans({ '%tab%': label }) }}">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-up text-[9px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </button>
                        <span class="tab-drag-handle w-5 h-4 flex items-center justify-center text-ink-faint hover:text-ink-muted cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none"
                              title="{{ 'settings.categories.reorder'|trans }}" aria-hidden="true">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-grip-vertical text-[10px]"></i>
                        </span>
                        <button type="button" data-action="settings--tab-order#move" data-direction="down"
                                class="{{ moveButton }}" {{ loop.last ? 'disabled' : '' }}
                                aria-label="{{ 'settings.categories.move_down'|trans({ '%tab%': label }) }}">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-[9px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    {% if tab.builtIn %}
                        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                            <p class="truncate text-sm font-medium {{ isOff ? 'text-ink-faint' : 'text-ink' }}">{{ label }}</p>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint">
                                {{ (isOff ? 'settings.categories.built_in_off' : 'settings.categories.built_in')|trans }}
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_categories_switch') }}" data-turbo="false" data-controller="ui--auto-submit" class="shrink-0">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-categories') }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="key" value="{{ tab.value }}">
                            <div class="grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-fr rounded-pane border border-line overflow-hidden"
                                 role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ label }}">
                                {% for on in [true, false] %}
                                    <label>
                                        <input type="radio" name="on" class="peer sr-only"
                                               value="{{ on ? '1' : '0' }}"
                                               data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                                               {{ isOff != on ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                                        <span class="{{ segText }}">{{ (on ? 'settings.categories.on' : 'settings.categories.off')|trans }}</span>
                                    </label>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    {% else %}
                        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_categories_rename', { id: tab.categoryId }) }}"
                              data-turbo="false" class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-categories') }}">
                            <input type="text" name="name" value="{{ tab.name }}" required maxlength="40"
                                   aria-label="{{ 'settings.categories.name_label'|trans }}"
                                   class="min-w-0 flex-1 h-8 rounded-pane border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-sm text-ink">
                            <button type="submit"
                                    class="shrink-0 h-8 px-2.5 rounded-pane border border-line text-xs text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-hover cursor-pointer transition-colors">
                                {{ 'settings.categories.rename'|trans }}
                            </button>
                        </form>

                        {# Through Turbo, unlike the forms above: data-turbo-confirm is
                           Turbo's, and with Turbo off the tab was deleted without
                           the question being asked. #}
                        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_categories_delete', { id: tab.categoryId }) }}"
                              class="shrink-0"
                              data-turbo-confirm="{{ 'settings.categories.delete_confirm'|trans({ '%name%': tab.name }) }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-categories') }}">
                            <button type="submit"
                                    class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-ink-faint hover:text-danger hover:bg-hover cursor-pointer transition-colors"
                                    aria-label="{{ 'settings.categories.delete'|trans }}"
                                    title="{{ 'settings.categories.delete'|trans }}">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-trash text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    {% endif %}
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    </div>

    <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_categories_create') }}" data-turbo="false" class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2">
        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-categories') }}">
        <input type="text" name="name" required maxlength="40"
               placeholder="{{ 'settings.categories.placeholder'|trans }}"
               aria-label="{{ 'settings.categories.name_label'|trans }}"
               class="min-w-0 flex-1 h-8 rounded-pane border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-sm text-ink">
        <button type="submit"
                class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 h-8 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-accent hover:bg-accent-strong text-accent-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            {{ 'settings.categories.add'|trans }}
        </button>
    </form>
</div>
